   "title": "README",
   "properties": {
    "ue_properties": {
     "widget_ue_connectable": {},
     "version": "7.4.1",
     "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
    }
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "PDD VIDEO UPSCALE (LONG) \u2014 MMH3SplitUpscale refines in 73-frame windows with 22-frame overlap and anchors, so any length works in one queue. Type the video path into the VHS loader, describe the content in the PROMPT node, queue.\n- Upscaler 'target dimensions' 1344x768 (or switch its mode to 'scale by multiplier').\n- Refine denoise 0.25 = last 2 PDD blocks: faithful sharpen. 0.5 = stronger re-synthesis (drifts more).\n- Recipe is PDD: euler + scheduler sigmas + CFG 1 + shift 12/3. \n- Output uses the SOURCE audio untouched (no audio VAE roundtrip); refined latent audio is discarded.\n- Source should be an H3-friendly length/fps; very long videos: cap frames on the loader and upscale in parts."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "PDD VIDEO UPSCALE (LONG) \u2014 MMH3SplitUpscale refines in 73-frame windows with 22-frame overlap and anchors, so any length works in one queue. Set the video path, describe the content in the PROMPT node, queue.\n- Upscaler 'target dimensions' 1344x768 (or switch its mode to 'scale by multiplier').\n- Refine denoise 0.25 = last 2 PDD blocks: faithful sharpen. 0.5 = stronger re-synthesis (drifts more).\n- Recipe is PDD: euler + scheduler sigmas + CFG 1 + shift 12/3. \n- Output uses the SOURCE audio untouched (no audio VAE roundtrip); refined latent audio is discarded.\n- Source should be an H3-friendly length/fps; very long videos: cap frames on the loader and upscale in parts."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
